        "No OpenAI Lean proof text reused. The proof composes existing local integral and spectral APIs; test fixture adaptation and exact local source identities are recorded in docs/provenance/evidence/8766-gaussian-ground/reuse.json.",
        "Native target, strict production, five complex-phase/truncation consumers and five standard-axiom guards passed at actual source revision 2ae6e2590cb787e3c9c252ca043686b44cbd93fc. The raw driver was added at 90bcaa0d425ad9f7916ce322edfcb229ecec8b9d; its command revision is preserved separately in verification.json. Public recovery checkpoint 16b81356549158a8393aaea5085defd4c5022e71 has tree 41d46a48626973c9056f36ca6163fe3b5e23665d, equal to local 90bc; its checked production and consumer blobs equal 2ae6. The earlier 000af37 failed invocation is retained unchanged except executor-path normalization."
      ],
